# Cloned third-party reference repos - never commit / never push
references/repos/*
!references/repos/.gitkeep

# Rain World Devlog offline archive (~1.3GB images/gifs) - never push
references/devlogs/rain-world-devlog-archive/

# Noita Wiki offline archive (XML dump, images, talks, curated extracts) - never push
references/wikis/noita-wiki-archive/

# Optional: keep local media out of git if it gets large
# Uncomment if needed:
# references/videos/
# references/screenshots/

# local archive tooling venv
references/wikis/.venv-archive/
